# Compliance

- Map each in-scope control or requirement to production evidence (artifact path + locator).
- Session decisions live in `docs/harness/decisions.md` (append-only).
- Do not mark compliant without cited evidence. Unowned gaps stay Open DQ.
- `/compliance-check` (security-agent mode `compliance`) must enforce this rule.
